msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 2a328424e0ed482f9064dfe7713c512b
msgid "Future general MTH5 direct I/O"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 cefbdd2425ef4e9ea618d4874b0e3152
msgid ""
"**Not currently a public direct-I/O format**. The only direct path today is "
"`ats.mth5`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:179 95f2dcd27d314de5991c193c8855ec2c
msgid ""
"Purpose: compare common seismic and geophysical readers without overstating "
"MTH5 support"
msgstr "目的: 地震・地球物理系 reader の違いを、MTH5 を過大評価せずに比較する"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:180 d277766a1ef94944b94884645bf9d3e1
msgid ""
"Input: existing waveform files such as MiniSEED, WIN/WIN32, or the limited "
"`ats.mth5` path"
msgstr "入力: MiniSEED, WIN/WIN32, または限定公開中の `ats.mth5` 経路"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:181 4e0697a7ba244152abb817d8d9d30ea3
msgid ""
"Output: `TimeSeries` or `TimeSeriesDict` objects depending on the reader"
msgstr "出力: reader に応じた `TimeSeries` または `TimeSeriesDict`"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:192 601421a43ac94dd7a321396726735bcf
msgid ""
"**MiniSEED** pads gaps with `NaN` by default. Use `gap=\"raise\"` if you "
"want failures instead."
msgstr ""
"**MiniSEED** はギャップがある場合、既定では `NaN` パディングされます。`gap=\"raise\"` で失敗させることもできます。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:193 ca0a40e97d48416696289baec2cab120
msgid "**K-NET** and **WIN / WIN32** are intentionally read-only."
msgstr "**K-NET**, **WIN / WIN32** は表のとおり読み込み専用です。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:194 c993a97bbea64125a9c7bf3fdc472a0f
msgid "**ATS.MTH5** is the limited current direct path."
msgstr "**ATS.MTH5** は利用経路が限定される current direct path です。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:195 1688baacd71d4f2ab9726038f710b65c
msgid ""
"**MTH5 standalone** is still in design/publication cleanup. Read this as "
"**\"`ats.mth5` has partial support\"**, not as **\"MTH5 direct I/O is "
"generally complete.\"**"
msgstr ""
"**MTH5 standalone** は設計・公開整理中です。**「MTH5 は対応済み」ではなく、「`ats.mth5` のみ一部対応」** "
"と読んでください。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:197 1d3f4c08e057499e82af7d56ef61142a
msgid "<a id=\"io-formats-en-c\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:199 eb73660549214a458438f24379fe1ba0
msgid "C. General Analysis and Exchange"
msgstr "C. 汎用・解析用"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:201 eb3a5b5d8b9c407b9df16e6d4eac5214
msgid ""
"These formats are useful for analysis notebooks, interchange, and general "
"storage. The key rule here is not to mix up “format choice” with “library "
"conversion.”"
msgstr ""
"解析ノート、外部解析、交換に向いた形式です。 このグループでは「保存形式として選ぶ話」と「他ライブラリへ変換する話」を混ぜないのが重要です。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 dbecce69d63e47b4ab0d30f2a3739dd4
msgid "**CSV** (`.csv`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 a2d200f361204df892cd64fdecbff64f
msgid ""
"`TimeSeries.read(\"data.csv\")`, `TimeSeriesDict.read(\"data.csv\")`, "
"`TimeSeriesDict.write(..., format=\"csv\")`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 3c10ed1012bc492c8892f272fe39dbfe
msgid "Lightweight exchange and inspection"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 bf3de15ea0b54d9ea7faa7f4da1a8d94
msgid "Auto-identifies `.csv`; simple CSV exchange is metadata-light"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 bc4e36f294bb4bd584f5a6be1a090fec
msgid "**TXT** (`.txt`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 96b36353ae8d46658d4216143430e036
msgid ""
"`TimeSeries.read(..., format=\"txt\")`, `TimeSeriesDict.read(dir, "
"format=\"txt\")`, `TimeSeriesDict.write(dir, format=\"txt\")`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 34b358e3ec4247079bae6178061d9afe
msgid "Plain-text exchange"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 d672ee0d2aff44c3998408ade324b3d3
msgid "**nc** (`.nc`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 63eab9af22bc4a8eaa456044a3a5f018
msgid ""
"`TimeSeries.read(..., format=\"nc\")`, `TimeSeriesDict.read(..., "
"format=\"nc\")`, `TimeSeriesMatrix.read(..., format=\"nc\")`, `.write(..., "
"format=\"nc\")`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 1b4c6c2daec44461804dd3e82108f2f0
msgid "Scientific storage for time-series-oriented data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 55ef0c707e2e4a9691935738307adc4b
msgid ""
"Direct I/O here is centered on TimeSeries classes; legacy format alias: "
"`netcdf4`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 801661c30978401cacfdca0c645ab6ed
msgid "**Zarr** (`.zarr`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 f6a3a944486446c4b04a448fe08a153a
msgid ""
"`TimeSeries.read(..., format=\"zarr\")`, `TimeSeriesDict.read(..., "
"format=\"zarr\")`, `TimeSeriesMatrix.read(..., format=\"zarr\")`, "
"`.write(..., format=\"zarr\")`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 98c3656742a84956b8f02306426c9730
msgid "Chunked storage and parallel workflows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 90bc1f84d1104a7394a1d8a06df0184e
msgid "Direct I/O here is centered on TimeSeries classes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 2110efde3635480fadaf7e43ad2ec90b
msgid "**ROOT** (`.root`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 eb4b9446093e43fd8446f93e9b6e0f90
msgid "`EventTable.read(\"events.root\")`, `EventTable.write(..., format=\"root\")`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 57b2b14a797b4102a30700cbab743694
msgid "EventTable I/O"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 b8897dc5ea01477b9e1f82bd1af7cf08
msgid ""
"Auto-identifies `.root`; direct I/O here is EventTable only and requires "
"`uproot`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:212 293a44244cef41c8ab1ec0dc29508d0b
msgid ""
"Purpose: show the general-purpose direct-I/O routes without mixing them with"
" interop-only bridges"
msgstr "目的: 汎用交換向けの direct I/O を、interop 専用の橋渡しと混同せず整理する"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:213 3a5ac413f51b48f5a71d410a505c7a69
msgid "Input: CSV, Zarr, ROOT, or other general exchange formats"
msgstr "入力: CSV, Zarr, ROOT などの汎用形式"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:214 6cadff7be0ad42c9909358cb2cdfcfaf
msgid "Output: `TimeSeriesDict`, `TimeSeriesMatrix`, or `EventTable`"
msgstr "出力: `TimeSeriesDict`, `TimeSeriesMatrix`, または `EventTable`"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:225 9b54afb559444474b0ca2a3937b871c2
msgid ""
"**CSV** remains useful for lightweight exchange and inspection. Treat simple"
" CSV files as metadata-light: use HDF5, GWF, Zarr, NetCDF, or a manifest-"
"backed collection directory when name, channel, and unit metadata must be "
"preserved."
msgstr ""
"**CSV** は素朴ですが、共有や確認には依然として有用です。単純な CSV ファイルは metadata-light "
"と考えてください。`name`、`channel`、`unit` まで保持したい場合は HDF5、GWF、Zarr、NetCDF、または "
"manifest 付き collection directory を使います。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:226 0907234939a24546beac7f21061da76d
msgid ""
"**TXT** direct I/O is more limited: single-series paths are explicit "
"`format=\"txt\"`, and multi-channel paths use collection directories."
msgstr ""
"**TXT** の direct I/O はより限定的で、単一 series は `format=\"txt\"` 明示、複数チャネルは "
"collection directory 前提です。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:227 d0a2e34e47bc49e9ac813ca3ff2838ef
msgid ""
"**Pickle** portability notes still exist in class references, but Pickle is "
"not a published direct `.read()` / `.write()` format on this page."
msgstr ""
"**Pickle** の可搬性メモは各クラスの reference に残していますが、このページでは Pickle を public direct "
"`.read()` / `.write()` 形式としては扱いません。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:228 5fec2a75055f47d79afbe22938dc989d
msgid ""
"**NetCDF4 / Zarr** are treated here only as **direct TimeSeries-style I/O**."
" Field/xarray bridges belong to interop. For NetCDF, `netcdf4` is a legacy "
"format token alias for `nc`; `.netcdf4` is not a documented auto-identified "
"extension alias."
msgstr ""
"**NetCDF4 / Zarr** はこのページでは **TimeSeries 系の direct I/O** としてだけ扱います。Field と "
"xarray の橋渡しは interop 側を見てください。NetCDF の `netcdf4` は `nc` の旧 format token "
"alias であり、`.netcdf4` は公開された自動判定 extension alias ではありません。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:229 39bc11aaa30245f586d0c8a2c969c4a7
msgid ""
"**Zarr** direct I/O now expects per-array timing metadata explicitly. "
"`sample_rate` is the primary key, `dt` is accepted as a fallback, and reads "
"raise `ValueError` if neither is present unless you intentionally recover a "
"legacy store with `sample_rate_override=...` or `dt_override=...`."
msgstr ""
"**Zarr** の direct I/O では、配列ごとの timing metadata を明示的に要求します。`sample_rate` "
"を優先し、`dt` は fallback として受け付けます。どちらも無い場合は `ValueError` を送出し、legacy store "
"を意図的に救済したい場合だけ `sample_rate_override=...` または `dt_override=...` を指定してください。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:230 bb68771ae9f945f78b6232bef3b140dd
msgid ""
"**ROOT** object-level export/import belongs to interop. This page only "
"covers EventTable direct I/O, which requires `uproot`."
msgstr ""
"**ROOT** の object-level 変換はここでは扱いません。I/O ガイドでは `uproot` を必要とする EventTable の直"
" I/O のみ扱います。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:232 d92d9692c0534384b8f243d11e81678b
msgid "<a id=\"io-formats-en-d\"></a>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:234 e371ea7a1d47412fb50b1da44b92cff2
msgid "D. Loggers and Instrument Formats"
msgstr "D. 計測機器・ロガー"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:236 397f4495e857412d939d998ccf7f7a08
msgid ""
"This group is for logger and instrument-specific time-series formats. Time "
"handling, units, and audio `t0` semantics are the main points to watch."
msgstr "ロガーや機材固有の時系列です。 時刻の扱い、単位、音声の `t0` など、フォーマットごとの注意点が比較的重要です。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 a3968f0d825c4e27ab742a0cd80ae28b
msgid "**GBD** (`.gbd`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 764b5a4a5e7d4742975f51eb593d9135
msgid ""
"`TimeSeries.read(..., format=\"gbd\", timezone=...)`, "
"`TimeSeriesDict.read(..., format=\"gbd\", timezone=...)`, "
"`TimeSeriesMatrix.read(..., format=\"gbd\", timezone=...)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 661d0222317e4ec294b600b66d793ca5
msgid "GRAPHTEC loggers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 baf8aaa3fcd141259f95f90049d36146
msgid "`timezone` is required for published reads"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 9769fc33829f4714ae842de0505148d6
msgid "**TDMS** (`.tdms`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 f1799ab639d94fb3aeeef347670bcb58
msgid ""
"`TimeSeries.read(..., format=\"tdms\")`, `TimeSeriesDict.read(..., "
"format=\"tdms\")`, `TimeSeriesMatrix.read(..., format=\"tdms\")`"
msgstr ""

