msgid "National Instruments data"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 dddf14a9b6074960a36f161244522e53
msgid "Read-only; requires `nptdms`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 840ee488a372441ca8ca2d400eceb4aa
msgid "**SDB / SQLite / SQLite3** (`.sdb`, `.sqlite`, `.sqlite3`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 73deabfa01cb4ad686c81b5e55361021
msgid ""
"`TimeSeries.read(..., format=\"sdb\" / \"sqlite\" / \"sqlite3\")`, "
"`TimeSeriesDict.read(..., format=\"sdb\" / \"sqlite\" / \"sqlite3\")`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 356330554455498295668fad75e35b7c
msgid "WeeWX and similar archives"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 c84f5260a85c46bea83379f5c66d5f60
msgid "Same reader family; public direct I/O is read-only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 74bcfa5149d24e00a7ba59d2131093f6
msgid "**WAV** (`.wav`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 6749d21a222c4d608accb424a3427c75
msgid ""
"`TimeSeries.read(..., format=\"wav\")`, `TimeSeriesDict.read(..., "
"format=\"wav\")`, `TimeSeries.write(..., format=\"wav\")`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 42c29f53537c4644a02a92725fbf4d51
msgid "Uncompressed audio"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 a41a420df3c040e9b823b61a358bcc5d
msgid "Public write is single-series only; does not preserve absolute time"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 8a8beec920ed47b0996aca50c35f1611
msgid ""
"`TimeSeries.read(..., format=\"mp3\" / \"flac\" / \"ogg\" / \"m4a\")`, "
"`TimeSeriesDict.read(..., format=...)`, `.write(...)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 147f4dfd5cea47e392d2bff353515a60
msgid "Compressed audio"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:16 d0fb4fe2496d4b948f70b45e55500331
msgid "Uses `pydub`; some formats also need `ffmpeg`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:247 a28d23f6e29a4f1481c0575415fd2004
msgid ""
"Purpose: highlight logger-specific and audio-specific direct-I/O "
"requirements"
msgstr "目的: ロガー系・音声系 format で注意すべき条件をまとめる"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:248 f5c47c4176ae444bb48044a1c4efc344
msgid "Input: logger data, SQLite-family archives, or audio files"
msgstr "入力: ロガーデータ、SQLite 系アーカイブ、音声ファイル"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:249 f9bf58e9f1004dc4a59e1cabd0478943
msgid "Output: `TimeSeries`, `TimeSeriesDict`, or `TimeSeriesMatrix`"
msgstr "出力: `TimeSeries`, `TimeSeriesDict`, または `TimeSeriesMatrix`"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:259 05f08ee088de43aaac395013fff466f2
msgid "**GBD** requires `timezone`."
msgstr "**GBD** は `timezone` を省略できません。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:260 2ee1c40c113d4a12bf8e27c4662129ae
msgid "**TDMS** requires the optional `nptdms` dependency."
msgstr "**TDMS** は optional dependency の `nptdms` が必要です。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:261 c2b264f518d545a080ba9646f63b274c
msgid ""
"**MP3 / FLAC / OGG / M4A** require the optional `pydub` dependency. MP3/M4A "
"commonly also need `ffmpeg`."
msgstr ""
"**MP3 / FLAC / OGG / M4A** は optional dependency の `pydub` が必要で、MP3/M4A は "
"`ffmpeg` も必要になることが多いです。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:262 d332142be85145a5aeedca2a94bb8c29
msgid ""
"**SDB / SQLite / SQLite3** should all be named explicitly in the public page"
" so users do not need to infer aliases."
msgstr "**SDB / SQLite / SQLite3** は同系統の reader です。公開ページでは 3 つとも明示して混乱を避けます。"

#: ../../how-to/io_formats.md:263 6b0f447c02314090a4961f8a5881deb3
msgid ""
"**WAV / compressed-audio formats** do not preserve absolute timestamps. "
"Reading with `t0=0.0` is a convenience convention, not a claim that the "
"source had an absolute epoch."
msgstr ""
"**WAV / 圧縮音声形式** は絶対時刻を持たないため、読み込み時は便宜上 `t0=0.0` "
"として扱います。「絶対時刻がある」という意味ではありません。"

